ntent":"`Collapsible`: `data-expanded`, `data-disabled`, and `data-focus-visible-within`."},"494":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-30","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#customization","content":"Trigger `Button`: `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focus-visible`, and `data-disabled`."},"495":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-31","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#customization","content":"`CollapsiblePanel`: `data-focus-visible-within`."},"496":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-32","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#keyboard","content":"| Key                   | Action                                                              |\n| --------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `Tab` / `Shift + Tab` | Move between the enabled trigger and controls in the expanded panel |","table":"table-0"},"497":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-33","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#keyboard","content":"| Key               | Action                                         |\n| ----------------- | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| `Enter` / `Space` | Toggle the section; focus stays on the trigger |","table":"table-0"},"498":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-34","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#aria","content":"`Button slot=\"trigger\"` renders a native button with `aria-expanded` for its open state and\n`aria-controls` linked to the panel automatically."},"499":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-35","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#aria","content":"`CollapsiblePanel` is labeled by its trigger through `aria-labelledby` automatically."},"500":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-36","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#aria","content":"`CollapsiblePanel` uses `role=\"group\"` by default. Keep it when the panel's content does not need\na navigation landmark; there is no need to set it explicitly."},"501":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-37","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#aria","content":"Set `role=\"region\"` on `CollapsiblePanel` when its content warrants a named landmark\nfor direct screen-reader navigation."},"502":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-38","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#aria","content":"Collapsed content stays mounted but is excluded from keyboard and screen-reader navigation."},"503":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-39","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#aria","content":"`Icon slot=\"indicator\"` is decorative and receives `aria-hidden=\"true\"` automatically."},"504":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-40","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#best-practices","content":"Use descriptive section titles and keep essential information visible."},"505":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-41","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#best-practices","content":"Choose heading levels that fit the page hierarchy and avoid deeply nested sections."},"506":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-42","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#best-practices","content":"Include text for status icons so their meaning is available to screen readers."},"507":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-43","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#best-practices","content":"Put links, forms, and actions inside the panel."},"508":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-44","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#best-practices","content":"Open the panel before moving focus to an input that needs attention."},"509":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-45","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#controlled-state-not-updating","content":"Update `isExpanded` from `onExpandedChange`. Changing `defaultExpanded` after mounting does not\ncontrol expansion. Inside Accordion, update the group's `expandedKeys` instead."},"510":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-46","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#trigger-not-expanding-the-panel","content":"Place `Button slot=\"trigger\"` inside the section's Heading. A Button without that slot acts\nindependently and does not toggle the section."},"511":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-47","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#input-values-persist-after-closing","content":"Panel content stays mounted when collapsed. Reset form state explicitly when the application requires it."},"512":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","type":"page","content":"DatePicker","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/date-picker"},"513":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-0","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/date-picker","content":"Date fields that display the selected value as a label and open a responsive calendar to pick a single date (DatePicker) or a range (DateRangePicker)."},"514":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-1","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/date-picker#features","content":"Features"},"515":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-2","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/date-picker#installation","content":"Installation"},"516":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-3","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/date-picker#working-with-dates","content":"Working with dates"},"517":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-4","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/date-picker#examples","content":"Examples"},"518":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-5","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/date-picker#mobile-1","content":"Mobile"},"519":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-6","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/date-picker#accessibility","content":"Accessibility"},"520":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-7","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/date-picker#props","content":"Props"},"521":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-8","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/date-picker#datepicker","content":"DatePicker"},"522":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-9","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/date-picker#daterangepicker","content":"DateRangePicker"},"523":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-10","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/date-picker#datepickercalendar","content":"DatePickerCalendar"},"524":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-11","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/date-picker#daterangepickercalendar","content":"DateRangePickerCalendar"},"525":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-12","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/date-picker#datepickervalue","content":"DatePickerValue"},"526":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-13","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/date-picker#daterangepickervalue","content":"DateRangePickerValue"},"527":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-14","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/date-picker#features","content":"**Composable interior**: Compose `Label`, a `Button slot=\"trigger\"`, `DatePickerCalendar`, and optional `Text` / `FieldError`. Nothing is added for you, and what you write keeps the order you wrote it in. `children` also accepts a function for picker state"},"528":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-15","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/date-picker#features","content":"**Trigger and calendar**: An empty `Button slot=\"trigger\"` renders a calendar icon and the formatted value from the field. `DatePickerCalendar` (and `DateRangePickerCalendar`) opens a responsive calendar: it takes `Calendar` props plus `popoverProps` and `drawerProps` for its overlay. Write `Popover`, `Content`, and `Calendar` yourself to replace the whole overlay"},"529":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-16","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/date-picker#features","content":"**Sizes**: Each picker is a `SizeProvider`. `size` (`sm`, `md`, `lg`) sets its label, trigger, description, error, and the calendar it opens; without it, the picker follows the surrounding scope"},"530":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-17","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/date-picker#features","content":"`DatePicker` (single) and `DateRangePicker` (range): a read-only formatted date label; the whole field opens a calendar"},"531":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-18","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/date-picker#features","content":"Built on React Aria - native form integration, validation, focus management, and screen-reader support"},"532":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-19","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/date-picker#features","content":"Label formatting via `formatOptions` / `placeholder` on the picker itself, or on `DatePickerValue` / `DateRangePickerValue` in a trigger you write"},"533":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-20","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/date-picker#features","content":"`minValue` / `maxValue` bounds and `isDateUnavailable` per-day disabling"},"534":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-21","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/date-picker#working-with-dates","content":"Values are `CalendarDate` objects. Import the date primitives you need from the `@godaddy/antares/date` subpath:"},"535":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-22","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/date-picker#working-with-dates","content":"Import date helpers from `@godaddy/antares/date` (a re-export of\n`@internationalized/date`).\nWrap the app in `<I18nProvider>` so formatting and the calendar follow the user's locale."},"536":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-23","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/date-picker#examples","content":"import { ArgTypes, Meta } from"},"537":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-24","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/date-picker#examples","content":"import { ArgTypes, Meta } from '@storybook/addon-docs/blocks';\nimport { Examples } from"},"538":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-25","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/date-picker#examples","content":"import { ArgTypes, Meta } from '@storybook/addon-docs/blocks';\nimport { Examples } from '@bento/storybook-addon-helpers/runtime';\nim"},"539":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-26","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/date-picker#mobile-1","content":"Below `40rem`, `DatePickerCalendar` and `DateRangePickerCalendar` open a bottom drawer with vertically\nscrolling months. Each drawer page contains three months by default. Use Previous/Next to change pages,\nchoose a month, or type a year to jump directly. The initial date follows `focusedValue`,\n`defaultFocusedValue`, the selected date (range start), then today, constrained by the date bounds."},"540":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-27","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/date-picker#mobile-1","content":"The overlay keeps its container until it closes, including during resizing. Its next opening uses the\ncurrent viewport. An initially open server-rendered picker keeps its popover through hydration."},"541":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-28","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/date-picker#mobile-1","content":"Set `overlay=\"popover\"` on the calendar to always use the desktop presentation."},"542":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-29","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/date-picker#mobile-1","content":"Use `drawerProps` for drawer presentation, such as `maxSize` or an accessible label. It defaults to\n`85dvh`. Open state stays on the picker; `popoverProps` configures the popover."},"543":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-30","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/date-picker#mobile-1","content":"`pageCount` sets the number of months in either presentation. Defaults: three in the drawer, one in a\nsingle-date popover, and two in a range popover. Scrolling stays within the current page. Navigation\nadvances by a full page, or by one month with `pageBehavior=\"single\"`."},"544":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-31","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/date-picker#mobile-1","content":"Range selection and endpoint dragging follow React Aria. Drawers default to `commitBehavior=\"reset\"`:\na calendar background press, focus leaving the calendar, or backdrop dismissal cancels a pending\nrange and preserves the previous value. Popovers default to `commitBehavior=\"select\"`, which commits\nthe pending range on background press or blur. Set `commitBehavior` on `DateRangePickerCalendar` to\noverride either default. Escape from a date cell cancels the pending selection."},"545":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-32","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/date-picker#mobile-1","content":"`shouldCloseOnSelect={false}` on the picker keeps either presentation open after a selection."},"546":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-33","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/date-picker#accessibility","content":"The drawer has the same accessible name as the picker. Escape, an outside press, or the screen-reader\ndismiss control closes it and returns focus to the trigger. Arrow keys and Page Up/Down retain React\nAria's calendar navigation. Scrolling does not move keyboard focus or change the selected value. The\nmonth/year controls follow the focused date, and each grid has its own month heading. Weekday\nlabels shorten when the calendar has limited space, including with enlarged text. The weekday row is\ndecorative; each date cell provides its full accessible name."},"547":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","type":"page","content":"Drawer","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drawer"},"548":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-0","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer","content":"An overlay panel that slides in from a screen edge, supporting sidebar navigation and bottom sheets."},"549":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-1","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drawer#installation","content":"Installation"},"550":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-2","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drawer#examples","content":"Examples"},"551":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-3","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drawer#accessibility","content":"Accessibility"},"552":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-4","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drawer#keyboard","content":"Keyboard"},"553":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-5","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drawer#aria","content":"ARIA"},"554":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-6","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drawer#best-practices","content":"Best Practices"},"555":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-7","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drawer#props","content":"Props"},"556":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-8","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drawer#drawer","content":"Drawer"},"557":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-9","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drawer#drawertrigger","content":"DrawerTrigger"},"558":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-10","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer","content":"An overlay panel that slides in from a screen edge. Built on the same RAC stack as `Modal` (a\nmodal overlay with an `elevation=\"overlay\"` panel and CSS transitions), it supports sidebar\nnavigation and bottom sheets."},"559":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-11","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer","content":"`DrawerTrigger` wraps a trigger button and a `<Drawer>`, handling open\nstate automatically."},"560":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-12","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer#examples","content":"import { Meta, ArgTypes } from '@storybook/addon-docs/blocks';\nimport { Examples } from '@bento/storybook"},"561":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-13","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer#examples","content":"import { Meta, ArgTypes } from '@storybook/addon-docs/blocks';\nimport { Examples } from '@bento/storybook-addon-helpers/r"},"562":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-14","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer#keyboard","content":"| Key      | Action                                                |\n| -------- | ----------------------------------------------------- |\n| `Escape` | Close the drawer (unless `isKeyboardDismissDisabled`) |","table":"table-0"},"563":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-15","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer#keyboard","content":"| Key   | Action                                          |\n| ----- | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| `Tab` | Move focus within the drawer (focus is trapped) |","table":"table-0"},"564":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-16","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer#aria","content":"`role=\"dialog\"` with `aria-modal=\"true\"` on the drawer panel (via RAC Modal)"},"565":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-17","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer#aria","content":"A `Heading slot=\"title\"` labels the dialog via `aria-labelledby`; otherwise pass `aria-label`"},"566":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-18","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer#best-practices","content":"Provide a `Heading slot=\"title\"` or an `aria-label` so the dialog has an accessible name."},"567":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-19","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer#best-practices","content":"Use `isDismissable` to allow closing via backdrop click."},"568":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-20","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer#best-practices","content":"Don't nest drawers."},"569":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","type":"page","content":"DropZone","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drop-zone"},"570":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-0","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drop-zone","content":"A standalone region that accepts drag-and-drop file interactions, rendering a clearly defined target area where users can drop files."},"571":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-1","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#installation","content":"Installation"},"572":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-2","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#examples","content":"Examples"},"573":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-3","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#accessibility","content":"Accessibility"},"574":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-4","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#keyboard","content":"Keyboard"},"575":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-5","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#screen-readers","content":"Screen readers"},"576":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-6","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#best-practices","content":"Best Practices"},"577":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-7","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#props","content":"Props"},"578":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-8","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#dropzone","content":"DropZone"},"579":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-9","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#examples","content":"import { Meta, ArgTypes } from '@storybook/addon-docs/blocks';\nimport { Examples } from '@bento/storybook-addon-helpers/runtime';\nimport * as Stories from './drop-zone.stories.tsx';\n\n\n\n## Installation\n\n```bash\nn"},"580":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-10","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#examples","content":"import { Meta, ArgTypes } from '@storybook/addon-docs/blocks';\nimport { Examples } from '@bento/storybook-addon-helpers/runtime';\nimport * as Stories from './drop-zone.stories.tsx';\n\n\n\n## Installation\n\n```bash\nnpm install -"},"581":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-11","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#examples","content":"import { Meta, ArgTypes } from '@storybook/addon-docs/blocks';\nimport { Examples } from '@bento/storybook-addon-helpers/runtime';\nimport * as Stories from './drop-zone.stories.tsx';\n\n\n\n## Installation\n\n```bash\nnpm install --save @godaddy/antares\n```\n\n## Examples\n\n<Examples of={Stories.Examples}"},"582":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-12","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#keyboard","content":"| Key   | Description                  |\n| ----- | ---------------------------- |\n| `Tab` | Moves focus to the drop zone |","table":"table-0"},"583":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-13","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#keyboard","content":"| Key               | Description                                                      |\n| ----------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `Enter` / `Space` | Opens the file picker so files can be selected without a pointer |","table":"table-0"},"584":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-14","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#screen-readers","content":"The drop zone renders a visually hidden `<button>` inside the container. Assistive technology discovers and announces this button as an interactive element — activating it opens the native file picker without a pointer."},"585":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-15","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#screen-readers","content":"The button's accessible name is built from two sources, combined in order:"},"586":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-16","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#screen-readers","content":"**`<Text slot=\"label\">`** — any `Text` child with `slot=\"label\"` has its `id` linked to the button via `aria-labelledby`. This is the recommended way to provide a contextual label that is also visible to sighted users."},"587":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-17","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#screen-readers","content":"**`aria-label`** — pass `aria-label` on the `DropZone` component to override or supplement the label (e.g. `aria-label=\"Upload profile photo\"`). When no `Text slot=\"label\"` is present and no `aria-label` is set, the button falls back to the default \"DropZone\" label provided by React Aria."},"588":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-18","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#best-practices","content":"Use the drop zone alongside a button-based file picker — drag-and-drop is a convenience, never the only way to upload."},"589":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-19","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#best-practices","content":"Replace the default text with `children` to communicate the accepted file types and size limits up front."},"590":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-20","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#best-practices","content":"Let the drop zone fill its container; constrain it with the surrounding layout rather than setting a fixed width on the component itself."},"591":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-21","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#best-practices","content":"Reflect upload state (validating, uploading, error) outside the drop zone so the target area stays clear and predictable."},"592":{"id":"/docs/components/field-error","page_id":"/docs/components/field-error","type":"page","content":"FieldError","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/field-error"},"593":{"id":"/docs/components/field-error-0","page_id":"/docs/components/field-error","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/field-error","content":"Validation message for a field. Renders only when the field is invalid."},"594":{"id":"/docs/components/field-error-1","page_id":"/docs/compon