","url":"/docs/components/file-trigger#features","content":"Resets the input value before every open, so re-selecting the same file still fires `onSelect`."},"614":{"id":"/docs/components/file-trigger-12","page_id":"/docs/components/file-trigger","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/file-trigger#examples","content":"import { Meta, ArgTypes } from '@storybook/addon-docs/blocks';\nimport { Examples } from '@bento/storybook-addon-help"},"615":{"id":"/docs/components/file-trigger-13","page_id":"/docs/components/file-trigger","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/file-trigger#accessibility","content":"`FileTrigger` adds no visuals or ARIA of its own — accessibility comes from the pressable child you provide. Use a component with an accessible name (e.g. an Antares `Button` with clear label text) so assistive technology announces the action. The underlying `<input>` is visually hidden but remains operable by keyboard through the child's press behavior."},"616":{"id":"/docs/components/file-trigger-14","page_id":"/docs/components/file-trigger","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/file-trigger#best-practices","content":"`acceptedFileTypes` is a best-effort filter for the OS picker — always validate file type and size again in your `onSelect` handler, since it can be bypassed."},"617":{"id":"/docs/components/file-trigger-15","page_id":"/docs/components/file-trigger","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/file-trigger#best-practices","content":"Pair `FileTrigger` with `DropZone` to offer both click-to-browse and drag-and-drop. See the DropZone \"File Upload\" example."},"618":{"id":"/docs/components/file-trigger-16","page_id":"/docs/components/file-trigger","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/file-trigger#best-practices","content":"Keep the child a single pressable element; `FileTrigger` forwards press behavior to whatever you nest inside it."},"619":{"id":"/docs/components/heading","page_id":"/docs/components/heading","type":"page","content":"Heading","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/heading"},"620":{"id":"/docs/components/heading-0","page_id":"/docs/components/heading","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/heading","content":"Semantic h1-h6 heading. Use slot=\"title\" inside a Modal or Dialog to name the overlay."},"621":{"id":"/docs/components/heading-1","page_id":"/docs/components/heading","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/heading#features","content":"Features"},"622":{"id":"/docs/components/heading-2","page_id":"/docs/components/heading","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/heading#installation","content":"Installation"},"623":{"id":"/docs/components/heading-3","page_id":"/docs/components/heading","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/heading#examples","content":"Examples"},"624":{"id":"/docs/components/heading-4","page_id":"/docs/components/heading","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/heading#props","content":"Props"},"625":{"id":"/docs/components/heading-5","page_id":"/docs/components/heading","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/heading#heading","content":"Heading"},"626":{"id":"/docs/components/heading-6","page_id":"/docs/components/heading","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/heading#features","content":"Renders `h1`-`h6` from the `level` prop (default `3`). The level never changes the visual size."},"627":{"id":"/docs/components/heading-7","page_id":"/docs/components/heading","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/heading#features","content":"Without `size`, takes the heading tier of the surrounding `SizeProvider`.\n`size` picks a step on the heading ramp (`xs` to `2xl`)."},"628":{"id":"/docs/components/heading-8","page_id":"/docs/components/heading","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/heading#features","content":"`emphasis` picks a feedback color and changes only the color."},"629":{"id":"/docs/components/heading-9","page_i