face corner."],[368,"**`FieldError`**: Displays validation error text below the group"],[1352,"**`Footer`** — the bottom region: secondary content and/or actions (a `<footer>` row that spaces its contents apart)."],[1354,"**`Group`** — semantic grouping container for field item controls. A parent field injects the box chrome."],[1351,"**`Header`** — the top region: title area and optional trailing close (a `<header>` row that spaces its contents apart)."],[689,"**`icon.content`**: Overrides the BentoIllustration component - affects SVG transformations (rotate, flip), accessibility attributes (`role`, `focusable`, `aria-labelledby`), viewBox calculations, and final SVG element rendering"],[688,"**`icon`**: Overrides the entire BentoIcon component - affects icon loading, caching, sprite/SVG mode switching, data attributes, and the overall icon wrapper"],[696,"**`ondemand(loader)`**: Register an asynchronous icon loader (returns unregister function)"],[697,"**`parser(svgString)`**: Parse SVG strings into React elements"],[695,"**`set(icons)`**: Synchronously add icons to the store"],[1532,"**`size` is the tier.** The eyebrow reads it on the `detail` ramp, the title on `heading`, and\nthe body on `body`, so there is no table to memorize. Without `size`, the lockup follows the\nsurrounding size scope. A tier is the same at every container width."],[1134,"**A step isn't clickable:** it has no `onPress`, so it's inert by design. Add `onPress` to make it interactive."],[677,"**Accessibility ready**: Built-in support for screen readers and keyboard navigation"],[217,"**Accessibility ready**: Keyboard navigation, screen reader support, and semantic HTML"],[681,"**Accessibility**: `aria-label`, `aria-describedby`, `role`, `title`"],[1358,"**Adopted** - inside a parent that provides its context (e.g. `Modal`), it picks up that parent's styling and spacing automatically. Consumer props still win over the adopted defaults."],[1496,"**Adornments**: Fixed text or icons before or after the input (e.g. `$`, `.00`, `px`) are composed inside `Group`, positioned by source order"],[1530,"**An explicit prop on a child always wins** over what the lockup supplies. Pass\n`<Tag slot=\"eyebrow\" size=\"sm\">` to break the pairing, for instance."],[1167,"**Arrow Down/Right**: Move to next radio button"],[1289,"**Arrow Left/Right**: Move to next/previous segment"],[940,"**Arrow Right/Left**: open/close a submenu"],[939,"**Arrow Up/Down**: move between items; **Home/End**: first/last"],[1168,"**Arrow Up/Left**: Move to previous radio button"],[232,"**Auto-sizing**: Uses VisX's `useParentSize` hook to adapt to container width"],[674,"**Automatic caching**: Once loaded, icons are cached for optimal performance"],[728,"**Automatic Caching**: Once loaded, the icon is cached in memory to avoid subsequent network requests"],[228,"**Bar padding** (multi-series): 4px between bars within a group"],[227,"**Bar width**: 12px (1.5 grid units)"],[679,"**Bento integration**: Extends Bento Icon with additional Antares-specific features"],[230,"**Border radius**: 8px on all bars"],[1610,"**Center** — when the group acts as a prominent toggle affecting an entire section or page."],[318,"**Chart container:** `data-width`, `data-height`, `data-x-labels`, `data-y-labels`, `data-x-labels-vertical`, `data-x-baseline`, `data-y-baseline`, `data-x-tick-marks`, `data-y-tick-marks`"],[752,"**Check browser console**: Look for network errors"],[266,"**Check container**: Ensure the chart container is not transformed or positioned in a complex layout"],[261,"**Check data**: Ensure `series` array has data and `xAccessor`/`yAccessor` return valid values"],[263,"**Check dimensions**: Ensure container has non-zero width and height"],[262,"**Check domains**: Verify `yDomain` (if set) includes your data values"],[750,"**Check icon name**: Ensure the icon exists in the CDN"],[265,"**Check scroll position**: The component accounts for horizontal scroll automatically"],[362,"**Checkbox:** `data-selected`, `data-indeterminate`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focused`, `data-disabled`"],[361,"**CheckboxGroup Container:** `data-invalid`, `data-disabled`, `data-required`, `data-readonly`, `data-orientation`"],[736,"**Client-Side Hydration**: The sprite sheet is generated and injected after hydration, causing a brief paint event"],[676,"**Color inheritance**: Uses `currentColor` by default for seamless theme integration"],[1495,"**Composable interior**: Compose `Label`, `Input` or `TextArea`, `Text slot=\"description\"`, and `FieldError`. Omitting `Group` leaves the control as a direct field child with box chrome. Use an explicit `Group` for controls or adornments"],[527,"**Composable interior**: Compose `Label`, a `Button slot=\"trigger\"`, `DatePickerCalendar`, and optional `Text` / `FieldError`. Nothing is added for you, and what you write keeps the order you wrote it in. `children` also accepts a function for picker state"],[1311,"**Composable interior**: Compose `Label`, a `Button slot=\"trigger\"`, `SelectOptions`, and optional `Text` / `FieldError`. Nothing is added for you, and what you write keeps the order you wrote it in"],[998,"**Composable interior**: Compose `Label`, the control, `Text slot=\"description\"`, and `FieldError`. Nothing is added for you, and what you write keeps the order you wrote it in"],[1313,"**Composed in another field**: Use `variant=\"control\"` to sit inside another field's `Group`, as a country-code select beside a phone `Input`"],[907,"**Composes into other components**: `Select` uses `ListBox` internally; reach for `ListBox` directly when you need an inline list rather than a popover dropdown."],[747,"**Consider preloading** frequently used icons to reduce loading delays"],[905,"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `selectedKeys` and `onSelectionChange` for controlled state, or `defaultSelectedKeys` for uncontrolled."],[1002,"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `value` and `onChange` for controlled state, or `defaultValue` for uncontrolled"],[1315,"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `value` and `onChange` for controlled state, or `defaultValue` for uncontrolled"],[1498,"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `value` and `onChange` for controlled state, or `defaultValue` for uncontrolled"],[1531,"**Controls keep the scale size.** A `Button` inside a lockup follows the surrounding\n`SizeProvider` or its own `size` prop, never the lockup's tier."],[1497,"**Controls**: A `Button slot=\"control\"` beside the input is an interactive affix; it picks up field chrome from context"],[843,"**Custom Components:** When using `as={MyComponent}`, Box accepts that component's props. If there's a prop name conflict, Box's props take priority."],[215,"**Custom domains**: Set explicit x and y ranges for controlled scales across multiple charts"],[214,"**Customizable axes**: Control gridlines, tick marks, axis titles, and tick formatting"],[270,"**Debounce resize**: The default 15ms debounce on `useParentSize` balances smoothness and performance"],[735,"**Deduplication**: Icon path data only exists once in the sprite sheet, regardless of how many times it's used"],[212,"**Design system alignment**: 8px border radius, 12px bar width (1.5 GU), consistent spacing"],[737,"**DOM Output:**"],[682,"**Events**: `onClick`, `onMouseOver`, `onFocus`, etc."],[1526,"**Every part names its role with a slot**: `eyebrow`, `title`, `body`. Unslotted text follows\nthe lockup's tier too: a bare `Heading` takes the title tier and a bare `Text` the body tier."],[753,"**Fallback content**: Provide placeholder content for loading states"],[741,"**Faster Rendering**: Browser optimizations for `<use>` elements"],[726,"**First Request**: When an icon is first encountered, it triggers an asynchronous fetch from the CDN"],[675,"**Flexible sizing**: Support for `width` and `height` props"],[1318,"**Form integration**: Set `name` and the value submits as part of a native `<form>` (multiple values submit as repeated entries)"],[729,"**Full SVG Rendering**: Each icon instance renders as a complete SVG element with all path data"],[229,"**Group gap**: Minimum 24px between bar groups"],[241,"**Grouped rendering**: Bars are rendered in SVG `<Group>` elements for logical organization"],[244,"**Horizontal charts**: Vertical scrolling when many categories exceed container height"],[233,"**Horizontal scrolling**: When data points exceed available width, the chart becomes horizontally scrollable"],[842,"**HTML Elements:** When using `as=\"button\"`, TypeScript enforces button-specific props like `type`, `disabled`, and `onClick`."],[833,"**Important**: Since `Flex` and `Grid` extend `Box`, prefer them for layouts. Use `Box` only when you need a non-flex, non-grid container."],[704,"**Important**: When you supply a `className`, you make a commitment to take over all styling of the component as it will remove the standard class names. Use data attributes for targeted styling instead."],[744,"**Initial Flash**: Brief moment where icons appear/disappear during sprite injection"],[213,"**Interactive tooltips**: Hover to see exact values, with smart positioning and scroll-awareness"],[367,"**isInvalid**: Shows error state styling"],[366,"**isRequired**: Marks the group as required with visual indicator"],[236,"**Keyboard navigation**: Bar groups are keyboard accessible with `tabIndex={0}` and `role=\"group\"`"],[906,"**Layout primitive**: `ListBox` and `ListBoxItem` accept layout props (`gap`, `padding`, etc.) — they extend `FlexOwnProps`."],[1609,"**Left** — when the group controls content directly below or within the same column (dashboards, tables)."],[269,"**Limit data points**: Consider pagination or filtering for very large datasets (>100 points)"],[740,"**Lower Memory Usage**: Especially beneficial with many repeated icons"],[231,"**Margins**: 20px top/right, 60px bottom/left for axes and labels"],[757,"**Minimize icon sets**: Only load icons that are actually used"],[235,"**Minimum spacing**: Group