h proper ARIA attributes"],[1286,"**SegmentedController Container:** `data-disabled`"],[1287,"**SegmentedControllerItem:** `data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focus-visible`, `data-disabled`"],[1349,"**Shared structural containers.** These generic, layout-only components are the building blocks for composing a component's interior (a `Modal`, a card, a panel). They are semantic containers built on `Flex`, so they accept the same layout props (`direction`, `gap`, `alignItems`, `justifyContent`, `padding`, ...)."],[372,"**Shift + Tab**: Moves focus to the previous checkbox"],[271,"**Simplify tooltips**: If tooltips are complex, consider using simpler content or disabling them"],[209,"**Single and multi-series support**: Display one or multiple data series with grouped bars"],[1314,"**Single or multiple selection**: Set `selectionMode=\"multiple\"` to allow multiple values"],[904,"**Single or multiple selection**: Set `selectionMode=\"single\"` or `\"multiple\"`."],[529,"**Sizes**: Each picker is a `SizeProvider`. `size` (`sm`, `md`, `lg`) sets its label, trigger, description, error, and the calendar it opens; without it, the picker follows the surrounding scope"],[1501,"**Sizes**: The field is a `SizeProvider`. `size` (`sm`, `md`, `lg`) sets its label, input, description, error, and composed controls; without it, the field follows the surrounding scope. An explicit `size` on a part still wins for that part"],[1000,"**Sizes**: The field is a `SizeProvider`. `size` (`sm`, `md`, `lg`) sets its label, input, steppers, description, and error; without it, the field follows the surrounding scope"],[1317,"**Sizes**: The field is a `SizeProvider`. `size` (`sm`, `md`, `lg`) sets the label, trigger, and options, which open at the same size even though they render in a portal. Without it, the Select follows the surrounding scope"],[1169,"**Space**: Select the focused radio button"],[371,"**Space**: Toggles the focused checkbox"],[938,"**Space/Enter**: activate 